Question: Monthly Transactions I (https://leetcode.com/problems/monthly-transactions-i?envType=problem-list-v2&envId=db-db2-filtering-aggregation)

SELECT
    DATE_FORMAT(trans_date, '%Y-%m') AS month,
    country,
    COUNT(*) AS trans_count,
    SUM(state = 'approved') AS approved_count,
    SUM(amount) AS trans_total_amount,
    SUM((state = 'approved') * amount) AS approved_total_amount
FROM Transactions
GROUP BY
    month,
    country;
